From: Arbion Halili <a.halili@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 22:31:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(castore/fs): select DAX per inode

Negotiate FUSE_CAP_PERFILE_DAX when a mapping cache is available and mark
regular files selected by `snix.dax` with FUSE_ATTR_DAX. Other files retain
ordinary reads, while setupmapping remains available for whole-mount DAX.

Change-Id: Ibf3aab099f8ac3fa174838eed53947e4ab17e484
---
